msgstr "Rules for Submission"

msgid ""
"Apps not requiring manual review can be submitted by logging in with the "
"\"Log In\" link above."
msgstr ""
"Apps not requiring manual review can be submitted by logging in with the "
"\"Log In\" link above."

msgid "You are only allowed to publish apps that you have permission to distribute."
msgstr "You are only allowed to publish apps that you have permission to distribute."

msgid "You are not allowed to impersonate someone else or another app."
msgstr "You are not allowed to impersonate someone else or another app."

msgid ""
"Your app can be pulled without warning at the discretion of our admins. "
"Where possible, we will contact you regarding any such actions."
msgstr ""
"Your app can be pulled without warning at the discretion of our admins. "
"Where possible, we will contact you regarding any such actions."

msgid ""
"Users using the OpenStore are expected to follow the UBports Code of "
"Conduct."
msgstr ""
"Users using the OpenStore are expected to follow the UBports Code of "
"Conduct."

msgid ""
"Apps requiring manual review must be submitted by contacting an admin in "
"our telegram group."
msgstr ""
"Apps requiring manual review must be submitted by contacting an admin in "
"our telegram group."

msgid "You must read over the content policy detailed below."
msgstr "You must read over the content policy detailed below."

msgid "Rules for Submissions Requiring Manual Review"
msgstr "Rules for Submissions Requiring Manual Review"

msgid ""
"Send us a link to a repository for your app to our telegram group along "
"with some instructions on how to build it."
msgstr ""
"Send us a link to a repository for your app to our telegram group along "
"with some instructions on how to build it."

msgid ""
"Give a short explanation why you can\\'t publish the app without extra "
"privileges. No need to go into details, a one liner like \"needs to run a "
"daemon in the background\" will do. List all the special features you have, "
"if there are more."
msgstr ""
"Give a short explanation why you can\\'t publish the app without extra "
"privileges. No need to go into details, a one liner like \"needs to run a "
"daemon in the background\" will do. List all the special features you have, "
"if there are more."

msgid ""
"If an application could be published without manual review if it wouldn't "
"be for that one cool feature, publish a stripped down version! Not everyone "
"will want to install apps with less confinement."
msgstr ""
"If an application could be published without manual review if it wouldn't "
"be for that one cool feature, publish a stripped down version! Not everyone "
"will want to install apps with less confinement."

msgid ""
"Only open source applications allowed for manual review: As the "
"applications might have arbitrary access to the device, every manually "
"reviewed app will get a source code review."
msgstr ""
"Only open source applications allowed for manual review: As the "
"applications might have arbitrary access to the device, every manually "
"reviewed app will get a source code review."

msgid "OpenStore App Content Policy"
msgstr "OpenStore App Content Policy"

msgid ""
"One of the main goals of the OpenStore is to provide a safe app store for "
"people of all ages. To accomplish this goal we do not allow certain types "
"of app to be published. Failure to follow the guidelines will result in "
"your app being removed. Any account with serious infractions may be subject "
"to termination. The OpenStore team thanks you for helping us promote a "
"better environment for everyone."
msgstr ""
"One of the main goals of the OpenStore is to provide a safe app store for "
"people of all ages. To accomplish this goal we do not allow certain types "
"of app to be published. Failure to follow the guidelines will result in "
"your app being removed. Any account with serious infractions may be subject "
"to termination. The OpenStore team thanks you for helping us promote a "
"better environment for everyone."

msgid "Prohibited Apps"
msgstr "Prohibited Apps"

msgid "Sexually Explicit Content"
msgstr "Sexually Explicit Content"

msgid ""
"Apps containing or promoting sexually explicit content are not allowed. "
"This includes, but is not limited to, pornography and services promoting "
"sexually explicit content."
msgstr ""
"Apps containing or promoting sexually explicit content are not allowed. "
"This includes, but is not limited to, pornography and services promoting "
"sexually explicit content."

msgid "Child Endangerment"
msgstr "Child Endangerment"

msgid ""
"Apps containing or promoting child abuse or child sexual abuse are strictly "
"prohibited."
msgstr ""
"Apps containing or promoting child abuse or child sexual abuse are strictly "
"prohibited."

msgid "Violence"
msgstr "Violence"

msgid ""
"Apps containing or promoting gratuitous violence are not allowed. This "
"includes, but is not limited to, violence, terrorism, bomb/weapon making, "
"self harm, and grotesque imagery."
msgstr ""
"Apps containing or promoting gratuitous violence are not allowed. This "
"includes, but is not limited to, violence, terrorism, bomb/weapon making, "
"self harm, and grotesque imagery."

msgid "Harassment, Bullying, or Hate Speech"
msgstr "Harassment, Bullying, or Hate Speech"

msgid "App containing or promoting any of the above are strictly prohibited."
msgstr "App containing or promoting any of the above are strictly prohibited."

msgid ""
"Apps containing gambling involving real world money transactions are not "
"allowed. This includes, but is not limited to, online casinos, betting, and "
"lotteries."
msgstr ""
"Apps containing gambling involving real world money transactions are not "
"allowed. This includes, but is not limited to, online casinos, betting, and "
"lotteries."

msgid "Illegal Activities"
msgstr "Illegal Activities"

msgid "Apps promoting illegal activities (based on USA law) are not allowed."
msgstr "Apps promoting illegal activities (based on USA law) are not allowed."

msgid "Malware"
msgstr "Malware"

msgid ""
"Apps that are found to be stealing the users data, trying to escalate their "
"privileges without user consent, or executing malicious process are "
"strictly prohibited."
msgstr ""
"Apps that are found to be stealing the users data, trying to escalate their "
"privileges without user consent, or executing malicious process are "
"strictly prohibited."

msgid "Submit App"
msgstr "Submit App"

msgid "App Name"
msgstr "App Name"

msgid ""
"This is the unique identifier for your app. It must match exactly the "
"\"name\" field in your click\\'s manifest.json and must be all lowercase "
"letters. For example: \"openstore.openstore-team\", where \"openstore\" is "
"the app and \"openstore-team\" is the group or individual authoring the app."
msgstr ""
"This is the unique identifier for your app. It must match exactly the "
"\"name\" field in your click\\'s manifest.json and must be all lowercase "
"letters. For example: \"openstore.openstore-team\", where \"openstore\" is "
"the app and \"openstore-team\" is the group or individual authoring the app."

msgid "App Title"
msgstr "App Title"

msgid "Failed to update your app:"
msgstr "Failed to update your app:"

msgid "You must be logged in to submit your app."
msgstr "You must be logged in to submit your app."

msgid "User profile on the OpenStore"
msgstr "User profile on the OpenStore"

